      "abstract": "Relief/Heriberto A. Sanchez-Mayen/City of St. Petersburg;  Provides an appropriation to compensate Mr. Sanchez-Mayen for injuries sustained as result of negligence of City of St. Petersburg; provides limitation on compensation & payment of attorney fees.\r\n        \r\nCLAIM:\r\n$2,300,000"
